pituitary macroadenomas</article-title><source>Eur J Endocrinol</source><year>2007</year><volume>156</volume><fpage>217</fpage><lpage>224</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17287411</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1530/eje.1.02334</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sibal</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Ball</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>Connolly</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>James</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kane</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelly</surname><given-names>WF</given-names></name><name><surname>Kendall-Taylor</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Mathias</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Perros</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Quinton</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Vaidya</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pituitary apoplexy: a review of clinical presentation, management and outcome in 45 cases</article-title><source>Pituitary</source><year>2004</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>157</fpage><lpage>163</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16010459</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s11102-005-1050-3</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yamaji</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Ishibashi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kosaka</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukushima</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Hori</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Manaka</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sano</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-grou